><strong>When to use this workflow:</strong> This workflow is ideal for sit=
uations where the task can be easily and cleanly decomposed into fixed subt=
asks. The main goal is to trade off latency for higher accuracy, by making =
each LLM call an easier task.</p><p class=3D"Body-module-scss-module__z40yv=
