translating it into a different language.</li><li>Writing an outline of a d=
ocument, checking that the outline meets certain criteria, then writing the=
 document based on the outline.</li></ul><h3 class=3D"Body-module-scss-modu=
le__z40yvW__reading-column headline-5 post-section" id=3D"workflow-routing"=
>Workflow: Routing</h3><p class=3D"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading=
-column body-2 serif post-text">Routing classifies an input and directs it =
to a specialized followup task. This workflow allows for separation of conc=
