lumn body-2 serif post-text"><li>Directing different types of customer serv=
ice queries (general questions, refund requests, technical support) into di=
fferent downstream processes, prompts, and tools.</li><li>Routing easy/comm=
on questions to smaller, cost-efficient models like Claude Haiku 4.5 and ha=
rd/unusual questions to more capable models like Claude Sonnet 4.5 to optim=
ize for best performance.</li></ul><h3 class=3D"Body-module-scss-module__z4=
