low</figcaption></figure></div><p class=3D"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW_=
_reading-column body-2 serif post-text"><strong>When to use this workflow:<=
/strong> This workflow is well-suited for complex tasks where you can=E2=80=
=99t predict the subtasks needed (in coding, for example, the number of fil=
es that need to be changed and the nature of the change in each file likely=
