igure></div><p class=3D"Body-module-scss-module__z40yvW__reading-column bod=
y-2 serif post-text"><strong>When to use agents:</strong> Agents can be use=
d for open-ended problems where it=E2=80=99s difficult or impossible to pre=
dict the required number of steps, and where you can=E2=80=99t hardcode a f=
ixed path. The LLM will potentially operate for many turns, and you must ha=
